  {
   "id": 226,
   "en": "Earth Federation Army Southern Europe Army -@Aviano Base",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 227,
   "en": "Aviano Base - Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "Saika",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Sieg, Sally.@Please wait here for a while.@Someone will come for you soon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "Yeah, got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Also, you'll be under constant watch on this base@too, and your movements will be heavily restricted.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "That's fine.@Normally, it wouldn't be strange@for us to be put in restraints.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "It hasn't been that long since I left this base...@but it feels nostalgic.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Minaki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Lieutenant, are you originally@from the unit here?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "I've been at this base too.@That's when I first met Major Kai@and Lieutenant Lamia.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Oh, I see.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "So, Lieutenant Aqua.@Do you know what's good at the base cafeteria?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Yes. Osso buco... braised veal shank.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Can you get that to go?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "I think so... Why?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Well, Italian food's delicious, right?@I thought I'd like Fairy and those two@to try some...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "...You mean us?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "Y-Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Why?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "Akemi and I talked a lot with Fairy, so...@how do I put it, um...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "We don't need your pity.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "No, it's not that.@It was my dad's company that found and recovered@the Ariard... so it kinda feels like fate.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "You're a nice guy.@If you're too sweet to me,@I might fall for you, you know?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Huh?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Heh heh, just kidding, kidding.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "O-Oh, okay.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "(To think we can have a conversation like this...@Their mentality is a lot like ours as Earthlings.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Security Guard",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Is Lieutenant Saika Shinagawa here?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Yes, that's me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "I'm Sergeant Massimo Bisio. I've come to take@custody of Sieg Altolied and Sally Emil.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Understood.@Well then, Sieg, Sally...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Don't go handling our Leonysis roughly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "It'll be carefully unloaded from the Hagane@after this. It's a valuable sample, after all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Akimi... I was glad you cared.@Will you tell Fairy we'll see her again?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "See you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "...Did you fall for her?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "N-No way!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "I wonder what'll happen to those two now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "I hear they'll be questioned at this base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "And after that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "They might come back to the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Huh...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "You mean they'll be treated the same as@the Ariard and Fairy?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Yeah. The Joint Chiefs of Staff are trying to@focus the enemy's aim on the Steel Dragons@as much as possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Plus, depending on how Gadisword and the@Golaikunru move, there's a good chance we'll be@sent to the Rabulpaila as the vanguard.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "If so, we might have them act as our guides.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "All pilots are being called. Let's go.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Hagane - Briefing Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "A ghost story, you say?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Yes. Someone on this base told me just now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "I mean, why would they tell you that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "I think they mistook me for a base visitor.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "So, what's the story?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "A corner of this base used to be an execution@ground... and the spirits of the condemned roam@night after night with bloody scythes, seeking company.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "...What a commonplace tale.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "We're fighting the Lamaris here.@Ghosts with scythes don't exactly cut it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Yeah, that's what I thought too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "...That legend is a little off.@The ghosts I saw once looked like executioners,@and they didn't carry scythes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Huh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "What do you mean?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "No way, you actually saw them?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Yes. Anyone entering the base, soldier or@<Military Contractor>, must clearly display@something showing their affiliation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "But those executioners were wrapped head to toe@in pitch-black cloaks, and appeared in the central@control tower. This was back at the <Inspector Incident>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Lieutenant, that's...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "That's enough chatter, you two. The Commander's here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "...Is everyone here?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Yes, sir.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Then let's begin the briefing. We've been on@half-watch rest since arriving at Aviano,@but that ends as of now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Base commander Rear Admiral Carlo Sacchi has just@requested an operation, and we've accepted.@Major Kai, explain the outline.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Yes, sir. Here it is.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "About two hours ago, a survey team headed to@Monte di Lupo went missing. So did the AM unit@that went along as escort.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "They were investigating an unidentified object@believed to have landed there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "It came to light when a climber reported finding a@huge hole deep in the mountains... but when, where@from, and what fell there is unknown.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "...A supernatural phenomenon, maybe?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Maybe it's got to do with the Fury or Gadisword...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "It might be the Ares Geist.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Hold on there, Sister 17.@It could be Dark Brain's lackeys, you know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Either way, sounds like a job for the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "But if something fell from space,@why wasn't it detected at the time?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "It may have fallen amid the confusion@right after the <Cross Gate Burst>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Then it could've taken a while to find.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "We'll head to Monte di Lupo to search for the@survey team and investigate the site.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "The Hagane will space-transfer in 60 minutes.@All pilots, stand by at Level 1 battle stations.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Captain, transfer to the destination is complete.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "What's the situation?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Nothing visible inside the impact hole.@Confirmed <Armored Module> wreckage nearby...@likely the survey team's escort units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "No life signs detected.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "So the survey team and escort were wiped out...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Commander.@I'll send out the mobile units to investigate@the site. Is that all right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Mm.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "All mobile units, launch.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "...This feeling... I think something's out there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Huh? Nothing on radar or sensors, though.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "I feel it too. Aya, what about you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Yes, there's a presence at eleven o'clock...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "This is like that time...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Yeah, same as back then.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Could it be...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Spiria 0 to Steel 2.@Something may be hiding near point 1109.@Requesting permission to attack.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Spiria 0, on what grounds?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "It feels like when we first encountered@Armara Burton of the <Gaia Savers>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "What...!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "What does that mean?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "It seems they sense a presence like that of@an enemy they fought in <The Sealing War>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "But there's nothing on radar or sensors,@is there?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "That's correct, but their senses can be trusted.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "I agree.@I'll give permission to attack. Is that all right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "Very well. Permission granted.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Spiria 0, roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Wh-What are those?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Canis and... a unit with no matching data.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "They seem to have used advanced stealth@technology to hide their form and presence.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "...Of all the people to transfer in,@it had to be the <Steel Dragons>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "(The presence I felt... was it that unit?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "And to be seen through...@I'd rather not think there's something@calling between me and that woman.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "(...I can't rule out the possibility.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "...Ein, you and the others carry the salvage.@We'll hold off the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Unidentified Soldier",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Four unknowns leaving the battle area!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Now then... you'll keep me company for a while.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Remaining unknowns appear to be@attacking us!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units!@Intercept the unknowns!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "...Ein and the others seem to be fully clear.@We're withdrawing too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "(That unit's pilot is...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "(They're not Gaia Savers remnants...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "All enemy signals in the combat area are gone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Commander, shall we pursue the enemy?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "I'll ask the Joint Chiefs of Staff for orders.@Until then, stand by at the current position.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "...Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "(The way that unit moved... Could it be...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "(To run into them in a place like this.@I didn't see that coming.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "(Why show up now, of all times...?!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "...How did it go?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Unfortunately, it wasn't what we were looking for.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "I see... Things don't go that smoothly, after all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "But the possibility has risen, if only slightly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "Yes.@What were once parts have come back to this side.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "I won't give up hope...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "Yes... We'll fulfill our duty as the Golar Golem.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "Monte di Lupo",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "Steel Dragons",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "...It seems they weren't remnants@of the <Gaia Savers>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Yes... Like Armara Burton,@they're of the Balshem series...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Artificial humans created by <Euzeth> Gozzo of the@<Ze Balmary Empire>... my younger siblings, so to speak.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "Were all of them there like that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "That... I wonder.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "The enemy pilots we fought before going to the@<Rabulpaila> didn't seem to be Balshem or@Machinery Children.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "But they can't be the same as you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "Yes...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "The W Series of artificial humans had Numbers@like me and Sister Aschen, as well as@mass-production types...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "Maybe the Balshem are the same way.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "Still, what the hell did that bunch@come all the way to Earth for now?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "Avenging Euzeth is the first thing that comes to@mind... but they're going about it pretty passively.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "A prelude to the <Balmar> attacking Earth...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "Even so, that's way too low-key.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "This time, at least, they seemed to be@investigating and recovering the fallen object.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "Could it be the four units that withdrew first...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "Did they know what had fallen there?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "That's not clear. They may have been@investigating precisely because they didn't know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "Either way, it seems one of the Balshem's goals@is to search for something falling from the sky.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "And it's very likely connected to Euzeth...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "(Something that fell from the sky,@connected to that man...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "Hagane: Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "To think the Dark Brain remnants@would attack Aviano Base...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "Did they target it while we were away...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "Most of its forces have been sent toward Paris.@That's nothing new.@If anything, the enemy's real aim is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "More news from Aviano!@Not just the Crystal Dragoon,@but a horde of Lamaris has appeared too!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "Wh-What?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "Commander. We'll space-transfer@as soon as we're ready.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "Yes, hurry the work!@If anything happens to that base,@it'll hamper our future operations!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}